      "side": 1,
      "message": "that is only an issue in the 6.12 kernel as you can see from here:\nhttps://elixir.bootlin.com/linux/v6.12/source/drivers/irqchip/irq-gic-v3-its.c#L3410\n\nIn the later kernels `itt_alloc_pool` has been introduced to handle this.",
